abstract: >-
  A dated, source-reviewed comparison of 18 Mac dictation products across
  speech processing, configurable cloud paths, offline availability, retention,
  account boundaries, platform requirements, caveats, named quantitative
  documentation cohorts, and first-party sources. Reviewed July 26, 2026;
  the IraVoice row was updated October 1, 2026 for IraVoice 1.0.
